msgid "NIS2 compliance path"
msgstr "NIS2 compliance path"

msgid "Scope and registration"
msgstr "Scope and registration"

msgid "Know whether you are an essential or important entity, and make yourself known to the authority."
msgstr "Know whether you are an essential or important entity, and make yourself known to the authority."

msgid "Management approves the security measures, oversees them and is trained."
msgstr "Management approves the security measures, oversees them and is trained."

msgid "Cybersecurity risk-management measures"
msgstr "Cybersecurity risk-management measures"

msgid "The measures listed by the directive: risks, continuity, suppliers, checks, access, MFA."
msgstr "The measures listed by the directive: risks, continuity, suppliers, checks, access, MFA."

msgid "Incident reporting"
msgstr "Incident reporting"

msgid "Handle incidents and notify significant ones within 24 hours, 72 hours and one month."
msgstr "Handle incidents and notify significant ones within 24 hours, 72 hours and one month."

msgid "Day-to-day compliance"
msgstr "Day-to-day compliance"

msgid "Measures not covered yet, missing evidence and recurring actions to carry out."
msgstr "Measures not covered yet, missing evidence and recurring actions to carry out."

msgid "Set your NIS2 entity category"
msgstr "Set your NIS2 entity category"

msgid "Record for each GLPI entity concerned whether it is an essential or an important entity: the ReCyF measures that apply depend on it."
msgstr "Record for each GLPI entity concerned whether it is an essential or an important entity: the ReCyF measures that apply depend on it."

msgid "Register with the competent authority"
msgstr "Register with the competent authority"

msgid "Provide your information to the national authority (in France, on the NIS2 services of the ANSSI), then record the authority or the CSIRT as an official contact and check its details every year."
msgstr "Provide your information to the national authority (in France, on the NIS2 services of the ANSSI), then record the authority or the CSIRT as an official contact and check its details every year."

msgid "Have management approve and oversee the measures"
msgstr "Have management approve and oversee the measures"

msgid "Have the security policies approved by management, keep their review up to date, and name who is accountable for each security activity."
msgstr "Have the security policies approved by management, keep their review up to date, and name who is accountable for each security activity."

msgid "Train management and staff"
msgstr "Train management and staff"

msgid "Deliver cybersecurity training, including to the members of management, and basic cyber hygiene awareness to staff."
msgstr "Deliver cybersecurity training, including to the members of management, and basic cyber hygiene awareness to staff."

msgid "Analyse and treat the risks"
msgstr "Analyse and treat the risks"

msgid "Keep a risk register with owners and review dates, choose a treatment for each significant risk and follow its actions."
msgstr "Keep a risk register with owners and review dates, choose a treatment for each significant risk and follow its actions."

msgid "Prepare business continuity and crisis management"
msgstr "Prepare business continuity and crisis management"

msgid "Have continuity and recovery plans, backups whose restoration is tested, and run at least one crisis or continuity exercise a year."
msgstr "Have continuity and recovery plans, backups whose restoration is tested, and run at least one crisis or continuity exercise a year."

msgid "Secure the supply chain"
msgstr "Secure the supply chain"

msgid "List the suppliers that matter for your security and evaluate each of them at least once a year."
msgstr "List the suppliers that matter for your security and evaluate each of them at least once a year."

msgid "Assess the effectiveness of the measures"
msgstr "Assess the effectiveness of the measures"

msgid "Carry out audits of your measures and treat the nonconformities they find until they are closed."
msgstr "Carry out audits of your measures and treat the nonconformities they find until they are closed."

msgid "Review the access rights"
msgstr "Review the access rights"

msgid "Run an access review campaign at least once a year and close it once every account has been reviewed."
msgstr "Run an access review campaign at least once a year and close it once every account has been reviewed."

msgid "Use multi-factor authentication"
msgstr "Use multi-factor authentication"

msgid "Import the multi-factor authentication status of the accounts and protect every account, administrators first."
msgstr "Import the multi-factor authentication status of the accounts and protect every account, administrators first."

msgid "Notify significant incidents on time"
msgstr "Notify significant incidents on time"

msgid "Mark the security incidents subject to NIS2, send the early warning within 24 hours, the notification within 72 hours and the final report within one month, and record the CSIRT to warn."
msgstr "Mark the security incidents subject to NIS2, send the early warning within 24 hours, the notification within 72 hours and the final report within one month, and record the CSIRT to warn."

msgid "Cover the ReCyF measures"
msgstr "Cover the ReCyF measures"

msgid "For each ReCyF measure that applies to your category, say whether it applies and set its implementation status, an owner and a due date."
msgstr "For each ReCyF measure that applies to your category, say whether it applies and set its implementation status, an owner and a due date."

msgid "Attach the evidence of the ReCyF measures"
msgstr "Attach the evidence of the ReCyF measures"

msgid "Attach at least one document to each measure marked as implemented, so that you can show it to the authority."
msgstr "Attach at least one document to each measure marked as implemented, so that you can show it to the authority."

msgid "Carry out the recurring actions"
msgstr "Carry out the recurring actions"

msgid "Enable the periodic reviews of access rights and privileged accounts, the backup restore test and the continuity test, and treat their tickets on time."
msgstr "Enable the periodic reviews of access rights and privileged accounts, the backup restore test and the continuity test, and treat their tickets on time."

msgid "No entity has a NIS2 category yet."
msgstr "No entity has a NIS2 category yet."

msgid "Set the category"
msgstr "Set the category"

msgid "NIS2 services of the ANSSI"
msgstr "NIS2 services of the ANSSI"

