msgstr "%s: overdue"

msgid "%s: up to date"
msgstr "%s: up to date"

msgid "This page guides you through the NIS2 obligations, criterion by criterion: for each one, it cites the article of the directive, shows where you stand according to the data already entered, and gives the screen to open to complete it, with its place in the menu."
msgstr "This page guides you through the NIS2 obligations, criterion by criterion: for each one, it cites the article of the directive, shows where you stand according to the data already entered, and gives the screen to open to complete it, with its place in the menu."

msgid "Follow the criteria in order, starting with the one marked as the next step. Click its button to open the screen concerned, complete it, then come back: the page is computed again each time. Nothing is changed automatically. In France, enable the ReCyF of the ANSSI to follow its measures, the missing evidence and the recurring actions."
msgstr "Follow the criteria in order, starting with the one marked as the next step. Click its button to open the screen concerned, complete it, then come back: the page is computed again each time. Nothing is changed automatically. In France, enable the ReCyF of the ANSSI to follow its measures, the missing evidence and the recurring actions."

msgid "Directive (EU) 2022/2555 (NIS2), articles 3, 20, 21, 23 and 32; ReCyF of the ANSSI"
msgstr "Directive (EU) 2022/2555 (NIS2), articles 3, 20, 21, 23 and 32; ReCyF of the ANSSI"

msgid "NIS2 compliance score"
msgstr "NIS2 compliance score"

msgid "A criterion met counts fully, a criterion partly met counts half. Criteria outside your rights are not counted."
msgstr "A criterion met counts fully, a criterion partly met counts half. Criteria outside your rights are not counted."

msgid "Directive (EU) 2022/2555 on EUR-Lex"
msgstr "Directive (EU) 2022/2555 on EUR-Lex"

msgid "Every criterion is met."
msgstr "Every criterion is met."

msgid "No criterion can be evaluated with your rights."
msgstr "No criterion can be evaluated with your rights."

msgid "The ReCyF of the ANSSI (NIS2 France) is not enabled: its measures, the missing evidence and the entity category are not followed here. Enable it in the frameworks of the plugin configuration if you are concerned."
msgstr "The ReCyF of the ANSSI (NIS2 France) is not enabled: its measures, the missing evidence and the entity category are not followed here. Enable it in the frameworks of the plugin configuration if you are concerned."

msgid "Directive (EU) 2022/2555"
msgstr "Directive (EU) 2022/2555"

msgid "NIS2, art. %s"
msgstr "NIS2, art. %s"

msgid "Your profile cannot read the data of this criterion: ask an administrator of the management system."
msgstr "Your profile cannot read the data of this criterion: ask an administrator of the management system."

